<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="Nexus — a simple Hello World landing page.">
    <title>Hello World | Nexus</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; background: #f5f2eb; color: #242b26; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
      header, footer { padding: 28px clamp(24px, 6vw, 88px); }
      header { font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 14px; }
      main { flex: 1; display: grid; place-content: center; padding: 60px 24px; text-align: center; }
      .eyebrow { color: #526b59; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .2em; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 128px); letter-spacing: -.075em; line-height: 1.05; margin: 20px 0 28px; font-weight: 600; }
      .intro { color: #626960; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .dot { display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #526b59; margin-right: 8px; }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid #deded3; color: #626960; font-size: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; justify-content: space-between; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>NEXUS</header>
    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">A small beginning</p>
      <h1>Hello World</h1>
      <p class="intro">Welcome to Nexus.<br>Every great idea starts somewhere.</p>
    </main>
    <footer><span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Built with Ruby on Rails</span><span>CS408 · Hello World</span></footer>
  </body>
</html>
